WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:19.120
By the time you watch this video 765 people
will be born and 321 people will die.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:28.290
You've been watching this video for 21 seconds
and in that time Americans have eaten 7,350

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.980
slices of pizza.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:38.219
By now 28,416 barrels of oil have been used.

00:00:38.219 --> 00:00:45.399
By now 19,000 tonnes of water have flown over
Niagara Falls.

00:00:45.399 --> 00:00:52.999
By now 690 million tonnes of water has evaporated
from the surface of the Earth.

00:00:52.999 --> 00:00:57.890
By now there have been 5 earthquakes across
the world.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:05.729
By now 6 million chemical reactions have taken
place inside your body.

00:01:05.729 --> 00:01:19.100
By now Apple has made another $339,930 dollars
and Samsung has made $475,833 dollars.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:26.740
By now 2,550 trees have been cut down in the
rainforest.

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:31.909
By now 4 violent crimes have happened in the
United States.

00:01:31.909 --> 00:01:38.750
By now the Universe has expanded by 4,200
miles.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:45.579
By now humans have killed 307 sharks.

00:01:45.579 --> 00:01:57.350
By now 480,000 stars have been born in the
observable universe and 3,000 stars have exploded.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:02:03.700
By now 101 aeroplanes have taken off around
the World.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:09.060
By now 212 people have gotten married.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:15.890
By now lightning has struck earth 9,000 times.

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:24.409
By now 5.6 million likes have been made on
Facebook and 800,000 photos have been uploaded

00:02:24.409 --> 00:02:26.269
to Facebook.

00:02:26.269 --> 00:02:33.470
By now 1.1 million tweets have been posted
on Twitter.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:41.040
By now 468,000 hours of video has been watched
on YouTube.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:48.680
By now $334,000 worth of goods has been sold
on Amazon.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:03:02.860
And by now 544 million emails have been sent,
70% of which are spam.

